	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Puto te accepisse literas, quas<note type="margin">a.R.: quasi!</note> misi per quęstorem <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>aerarium a <persName ref="p20430">Valentino Nusboum</persName> acceptas; si non accepisti, sign<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ifica.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quid censes futurum in conciliabulo Satanico <placeName ref="l1107">Tridenti</placeName>?</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Episcopi <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><placeName ref="l1028">Trevirensis</placeName> et <placeName ref="l307">Maguntinensis</placeName> Selestadii fuere, sed honore solito sunt acce<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>pti, non episcopali; idem fecerunt et <placeName ref="l64">Brisacenses</placeName> mei, <placeName ref="l922">Friburgenses</placeName> autem <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>honorifice campanis, candelis, vexillis, crucibus et reliquis; <foreign xml:lang="de">das gantz <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>pfaffengeschwirm ist inen entgegen gezogen.</foreign></s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Episcopi crucibus dandis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>populo prodigi fuerunt; stultus populus indignus est ulla sana doctrina.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Iam agunt <placeName ref="l1107">Tridenti</placeName>; consultabunt omnia adversus Christum et verbum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>eius neque ob aliud convenerunt.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName> quatuor episcopi consultarunt <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>de concionatoribus eiiciendis; duo repugnarunt expectare volentes consilium <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>papale, sed reliqui duo C [aesare] annuente cum <placeName ref="l875">Hispanis</placeName> obtinuerunt, ut <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>mox proscriberentur idque in terrorem reliquarum civitatum, quo vident <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><persName ref="p18538">Caesarem</persName> bene velle catholicis veteribus.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quid denique putas futurum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>cum principe optimo <persName ref="p1546">Christophero Wirtembergensi</persName>?</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">annuet absque dubio <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ad omnia, quae Cęsariani praescripturi sunt ei tam in religione <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quam in aliis rebus exteris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Navigia quaedam contra <placeName ref="l2510">Turcam</placeName> missa submersa sunt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/><placeName ref="l449">Silesia</placeName> est in armis, ne <placeName ref="l2510">Turca</placeName> irruat in confinia, idque ab <placeName ref="l66">Vratis<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>laviensi</placeName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">... aus <placeName ref="l66">Breslau</placeName>.</note> habeo, qui hisce diebus apud nos fuit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernates</placeName> disceptant cum dominis <placeName ref="l822">Theutonici</placeName> ordinis; nondum res <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ad finem deducta est.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Vides, quomodo istud hominum genus cristas <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>attollat, et nos ita insensati sumus, ut nihili curamus omnia, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>quę agunt, nihilque praemeditantes in futurum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Quo fit, quod nullę annotationes in 1. ep. Pauli ad Corinthios <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ad nos mittantur?</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale et rescribe; ocium enim nunc <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>habes commodissimum.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Mitto praeterea <persName ref="p8418">Myconii</persName> nostri literas, qui <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>lecto affixus est fere perpetuo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Dux <persName ref="p8098">Georgius Wirtembergensis</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>vocavit ad se Erbium; fortassis scripsit <persName ref="p1546">Christophorus</persName> dux, ut ableget <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>concionatores.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName> habent <persName ref="p18137">Marpachium</persName> <placeName ref="l558">Witenbergę</placeName>, qui consulte<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>t cum <placeName ref="l749">Saxonibus</placeName>, hoc et <placeName ref="l558">Wittenbergensibus</placeName>, <placeName ref="l284">Lipsiensibus</placeName> et <placeName ref="l157">Francofordiensi[bu]s</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>quid velint respondere concilio suspecto <placeName ref="l1107">Tridenti</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Brevi plura.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>D. <lb xml:id="p1z34"/><persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName> salutabis meo nomine.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de">10. septembris 15<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>51.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Ohne Unterschrift.]</note>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName> suo <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ad manus.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
